<title>SOUTH KOREA: Sunkyong wins $161 mln Kuwait construction order.</title>
<headline>Sunkyong wins $161 mln Kuwait construction order.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Sunkyong Engineering and Construction Co said on Wednesday it had won a $160.93 million order from a Kuwait state company to build a natural gas processing plant on a turn-key basis.  </p>
<p>A Sunkyong spokesman said the contract was awarded by Kuwait National Petroleum Co. Construction and test operations are scheduled to be completed by the end of March 1999.</p>
<p>The plant will have the capacity to process 5.95 million cubic metres of natural gas and 62 million cubic metres of liquified natural gas per day, he said.</p>
<p>-- Seoul newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
